---
# k8s fork of roles/containers/homepage/templates/docker.yaml.j2 — genuinely diverges, so it
# is not read from the Docker role's template like the rest of this Secret's keys are.
#
# The Docker copy points Homepage's docker-proxy status dots at `my-docker` (docker-proxy on
# the Docker network). There is no k8s equivalent yet — a kubernetes-widget-backed status dot
# is a later decision — so this renders empty. services.yaml.j2 (this role's own fork) drops
# the matching `server:`/`container:` keys so tiles render dot-less instead of erroring on a
# `my-docker` host that doesn't exist here.
